Conflicts: alsa-ucm-conf-asahi
Replaces: alsa-ucm-conf-asahi
Description: ALSA UCM profiles for Apple Silicon Macs (Aurora)
 Aurora Silicon's ALSA Use Case Manager profiles for the built-in audio of
 Apple Silicon Macs, including the MacBook Neo (J700). They replace Debian's
 alsa-ucm-conf-asahi. Speaker output additionally requires Aurora's speaker
 protection, which the aurora-audio package provides.
